From ec850f9c9d46f3d778d45ae63e18dc4dab49d9cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iorta TechNXT <iortatechnxt22@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:09:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add the BDOI theme layer: palette, Nunito, shell and
 sign-in styles

- src/theme/bdoi/primereact-bdoi.css: the PrimeReact lara theme with the
  BDO Style Guide palette and Nunito, generated by
  scripts/build-bdoi-theme.js (npm run theme:bdoi).
- src/theme/bdoi/tokens.scss and bdoi.scss: design tokens and the styles
  of the shell (white sidebar with Header Blue navigation, white top bar,
  Dirty White content), tables (Header Blue heads, alternate rows), tabs
  (yellow top bar), 8 px controls, 12 px cards and the sign-in page.
- Brand: BDO Insure logo and "BIBS - BDOI Broker System" in the sidebar
  and on sign-in, "Powered by" iorta TechNXT; sign-in photo from the
  BDOI UX pack.
- Nunito bundled with @fontsource/nunito.

Styling only: no screen, route or API change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QpQXMLBHeDzTeTyCLm6kBF
